const PET108 = `I can look after your pet!\nPet Sitter Finder is the perfect app for pet lovers and pet owners. It helps pet owners find ______________________________. When a pet owner is looking for pet sitters, he or she uploads a post. Pet sitters or dog walkers can then send messages to the owner. The owner checks their reviews and chooses the best person.\n\nGeorge : November 12, 2019\nI use this app to look for a pet sitter whenever I'm going out of town. I have some concerns about my personal information, though. What if people use my phone number for other purposes?\n\nJane : November 14, 2019\nOur company is aware of this issue. I am now developing a system that allows users to communicate freely without showing their personal information.\n\n${P_SAM}`;
